  "rationale": "Immutable provenance rerun of the predeclared 100-transition secondary stability trace. Existing unlocked outputs are preserved and were not used to alter any experimental choice. Locked rerun1 stopped during a data-free preflight because its lock named the /usr/bin/python3 symlink while verification normalized it to /usr/bin/python3.10; it created no task claim and ran no numerical code. Rerun2 corrects only that pathname. Rerun2 array 394115 then exposed a Slurm identifier ambiguity: rank 8,192 completed, but rank 32,768 stopped in the outer scheduler verifier before numerical code because its bare SLURM_JOB_ID also named the array master and returned two scontrol records. Both claims and the completed rank-8,192 artifact remain preserved. Rerun3 changes only the scontrol selector to the unambiguous ArrayJobID_TaskID form and reruns both preregistered ranks.",
